  "goggles.fundamentals.mixer_settler.casing": "Casing: a stage is three across and three along",
  "goggles.fundamentals.mixer_settler.crud": "Crud at the interface: a dirty feed has fouled the organic; drain it and scrub it with lime",
  "goggles.fundamentals.mixer_settler.emulsion": "The mixer is too fast: the phases emulsify and will not settle",
